      "pronunciationText": "The first four terms are eight, six, four and two. S four adds all four of them, to make twenty. In sigma notation, it's the sum, from k equals one to four, of ten minus two k. Two is wrong. That's a sub four, the fourth term, not the sum of the first four terms."
